-
-2. **Prune Gaussians:**
-   Remove any Gaussian $g_i$ where:
-   $$ \lambda_i \leq \mu_\lambda - z_\lambda \sigma_\lambda $$
-   where $z_\lambda$ is a z-score threshold, typically set to 2 [S1, unofficial].
-
-3. **Compute Splitting Statistics:**
